,"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Crawford County runs from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025, on the middle of the grids, August to September came in at 43% of normal and November to December at 43%. April to May is the wettest pair at 9.09 inches of normal. Grid 21155 had its driest year in 1953 at 48% of normal.</p>"}
